module IO/Console

# Mielia's surface of the console readers that return lists: Mielia lists. A Mielia program calls these in place
# of the Revare routines of the same names.

### Reads all remaining input and splits it into lines. Windows line endings count as one.
### :throws: {MalformedUtf8Error} when the input is not well-formed UTF-8.
routine ask_lines() -> List[Text]
    return ask_lines().to[List[Text]]()

### Reads all remaining input and splits it into lines, as {ask_lines} does, replacing malformed UTF-8 with U+FFFD.
routine ask_lines_lossy() -> List[Text]
    return ask_lines_lossy().to[List[Text]]()

### Reads all remaining input and splits it into the words between runs of whitespace.
### :throws: {MalformedUtf8Error} when the input is not well-formed UTF-8.
routine ask_words() -> List[Text]
    return ask_words().to[List[Text]]()

### Reads all remaining input and splits it into the words between runs of whitespace, replacing malformed UTF-8
### with U+FFFD.
routine ask_words_lossy() -> List[Text]
    return ask_words_lossy().to[List[Text]]()
